a model card naming the module as Verilog-A spells it (MixRes), as runme.sim's psp103va would be PSP103VA
ground 0
load "resistor.osdi"
load "MixRes.va"
model vamos_vsource vsource
model vamos_resistor resistor
model m__va MixRes
V1 (a 0) vamos_vsource type="dc" dc=1
X1 (a b) m__va
R2 (b 0) vamos_resistor r=1000.0
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  save v(b)
  analysis op1 op
endc
